# Wave 4 Gate-5 fixture: image slide with the ADVERTISED schema keyword `image` + alt.
#
# Used by: test_bc_1_16_001_wave4_gate5_image_advertised_keyword_fails_e_a11_001
# (negative Red Gate — proves the defect: `image` keyword not threaded → E-A11-001)
#
# This fixture uses the `image` field name as advertised in image.rs required_fields()
# and known_fields.rs. Stage 2b threading reads "src" NOT "image", so no
# ContentBlock::Image is emitted → layout retains AltText::Unspecified → strict
# validation fires E-A11-001 even though a valid alt is supplied.
#
# This test FAILS BEFORE THE FIX (E-A11-001 fires).
# After the fix (image.rs + known_fields.rs aligned to "src"), a user authoring
# with "image" keyword would get an unknown-field warning but no blocking error
# at the threading level (the field simply won't thread).

slideforge_version "1"
lang "en-US"

slide image:
  title "Product Screenshot"
  image "screenshot.png"
  alt "The main dashboard showing Q3 metrics"
